    "spec": "Return 'telephoneDisplay' = the stored E.164 telephone formatted for humans (country code, space, grouped national digits, e.g. '+61 412 345 678'); keep 'telephone' as raw E.164.",
    "prompt": "Implement the following change to the application so that it fully satisfies\nthe specification and all existing and new tests pass. Run the test suite and\nmake it green before finishing.\n\nReturn 'telephoneDisplay' = the stored E.164 telephone formatted for humans (country code, space, grouped national digits, e.g. '+61 412 345 678'); keep 'telephone' as raw E.164.\n"
